  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Kuerz gesot sinn ech deng perséinlech Assistentin<br/>an ëmmer do, wann s du mech brauchs.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Moien, ech sinn d’Cortana.<br/>Ech kann dir dobäi hëllefen, vill Saache méi séier ze erleedegen.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Cortana ass deng perséinlech Assistentin, mat deem senger Hëllef s du Aufgaben exzellent a pünktlech erleedege kanns.<br/><br/>Dermat Cortana dir eng personaliséiert Benotzung a relevant Virschléi ubidde kann, sammelt a benotzt Microsoft Informatioune wéi d’Positioun an de Positiounshistorique, Kontakter, Sprooch-Input, Sprooch- an Handschrëftmusteren, den Tipphistorique, de Sichhistorique, Kalennerdetailer, den Inhalt an de Kommunikatiounshistorique aus Noriichten an Apps souwéi weider Informatiounen op dengem Apparat. Op Microsoft Edge sammelt a benotzt Cortana Donnéeën aus dem Navigatiounshistorique. Probéier einfach aus, wat sech Cortana am Notizbuch mierke kann. Du kanns Cortana och iwwer Microsoft Edge desaktivéieren.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Äert Passwuert aginn
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=LB-LU: Gitt Äert Passwuert aus Sécherheetsgrënn nach eng Kéier an.
